        ":question/id": "31e3e57f-c276-5662-b84c-e33c979975f9",
        ":question/problem": "$\\int 7cos\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y=$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int cos\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y=sin\u2061y+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int 7cos\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y & =7\\int cos\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =7(sin\u2061y)+C \\\\  & =7sin\u2061y+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
      "role": "independently authored inventory",
