        ":question/id": "673f2b41-3aca-57fa-8a91-06fa6e9a0b89",
        ":question/problem": "$\\int (7cos\u2061x+4sin\u2061x)\\,\\text{d}x=$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int sin\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x & =-cos\u2061x+C, \\\\ \\int cos\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x & =sin\u2061x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (7cos\u2061x+4sin\u2061x)\\,\\text{d}x & =7\\int cos\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x+4\\int sin\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =7sin\u2061x+4(-cos\u2061x)+C \\\\  & =7sin\u2061x-4cos\u2061x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
      "role": "independently authored inventory",
      "relationship_to_source_templates": "Registered basis1875 generated variant of q-113907, q-113908 or q-113909; same single coefficient or two-term constant multiple/sum-rule backbone. No original difficulty evidence."
